  "description": "Iterative LP-dual at H_6 for the deuteron β_D per term7-alpha5's prop:mass-formula-iterative-lp-dual.  Computes u^{(ℓ)*}(β_D) = m_e · Σ_λ y_λ(q_0) · c_ℓ(λ) · χ^λ(β_D) / [6]_q! for ℓ ∈ {0,…,6} with y_λ from y-lambda-mpfr-witness.json (50 dps, 11 partitions of 6) and χ^λ(β_D) computed numerically by applying the deuteron's atom_braid_word_3A(1,1) (23 crossings) to Hoefsmit seminormal matrices for each partition.  Cross-validates Σ_λ y_λ·χ^λ(β_D) against the closed-form |tr_M(β_D)| = 0.388 from wenzl_n6_closed_form.witness.json.  Reports Σ_ℓ u^{(ℓ)*}(β_D) and compares to CODATA M_D, Z·m_p+N·m_n, AME B(D).",
